# Talent Evaluator

**AI-Powered Candidate Assessment System**  
*Streamlining Your Recruitment Process*

---

## 📌 Overview

**Talent Evaluator** is an intelligent recruitment assistant designed to make hiring faster, fairer, and more effective[cite: 1]. Instead of manually reviewing dozens of resumes, the system automatically analyzes candidate qualifications against specific job requirements and generates comprehensive evaluation reports[cite: 1].

---

## 🎯 Key Problems Solved

Talent Evaluator addresses several common challenges in traditional recruitment[cite: 1]:
* **Time-consuming manual screening:** Eliminates long hours spent scanning resumes[cite: 1].
* **Inconsistent evaluation criteria:** Prevents shifting standards when assessing different candidates[cite: 1].
* **Risk of unconscious bias:** Reduces subjective bias during initial candidate screening[cite: 1].
* **Difficulty in objective comparisons:** Makes it easy to compare candidates on equal grounds[cite: 1].
* **Volume limitations:** Effortlessly manages high application volumes without adding overhead[cite: 1].

---

## 🚀 How It Works

1. **Input Job Details:** Enter your job description or generate one with AI[cite: 1].
2. **Upload Resumes:** Add candidate resumes in PDF format[cite: 1].
3. **Run Evaluation:** Click **"Evaluate Candidates"**[cite: 1].
4. **Review Results:** Access detailed assessment reports and data-backed insights[cite: 1].

---

## 📊 Evaluation Dimensions

Candidates are evaluated across four key dimensions[cite: 1]:

| Metric | What It Measures | Why It Matters |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Soft Skills**[cite: 1] | Communication, teamwork, adaptability, leadership, problem-solving[cite: 1] | Predicts cultural fit and collaboration success[cite: 1] |
| **Hard Skills**[cite: 1] | Technical abilities, programming languages, tools, certifications[cite: 1] | Ensures candidate can perform core job tasks[cite: 1] |
| **Potential**[cite: 1] | Growth trajectory, learning capacity, innovation, motivation[cite: 1] | Identifies future high-performers[cite: 1] |
| **Overall**[cite: 1] | Comprehensive fit combining all metrics[cite: 1] | Provides a holistic candidate assessment[cite: 1] |

